  "ruleText": "Env-A 4202.09 “Bituminous roof primer” means a primer that incorporates bitumens and is formulated and labeled exclusively for roofing.\n\nSource. #8695, eff 7-27-06, ss by #10736, eff 1-1-15 (formerly Env-A 4202.01(i)); ss by #14202, eff 2-26-25",
